# Python tools for charts/podiumd/bin/'s scripts, tests, and verify-podiumd's
# markdown and yamllint checks — see charts/podiumd/bin/README-release-process.md#setup.
# Unpinned here; requirements.txt pins them (uv pip compile), so local runs and
# CI use the same versions. New tool versions arrive as Renovate's weekly
# lock file maintenance PR, not unannounced in a CI run.
ruff
pymarkdownlnt
yamllint
pylint
vulture
isort
pytest
pytest-cov
pytest-xdist  # run_python_checks runs the tests in parallel (-n auto)
bandit
basedpyright
jscpd
flake8-pyproject  # flake8 reads [tool.flake8] in pyproject.toml
wemake-python-styleguide  # flake8 plugin, brings its own pinned flake8
flake8-bugbear
flake8-class-attributes-order
flake8-functions-names
deptry
pip-audit
# Imported by the charts/podiumd/scripts/migrate-*.py scripts that tests/migrate-scripts/ load.
ruamel.yaml
# Imported by lib/ and the scripts as yaml.
pyyaml
